OL,3,GNEWSAEstate to build 'UK's largest
OL,4,Abeaver enclosure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owners of an estate in
OL,7,FGloucestershire have plans to build
OL,8,Fwhat they said would be the largest
OL,9,Fbeaver enclosure in the UK.
OL,11,FElmore Court, a Grade II listed mansion
OL,12,Fby the River Severn near Stroud, is
OL,13,Fplanning a reconstruction of its land
OL,14,Fto include a new beaver enclosure as
OL,15,Fwell as the introduction of wild ponies
OL,16,Fand pigs as part of a rewilding project
OL,17,Fstarted in 2020.
OL,19,F"The next chapter will see the
OL,20,Fconstruction of the UK's largest beaver
OL,21,Fenclosure," a spokesperson for the
OL,22,Festate said.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
