OL,3,GNEWSAEstate to build 'UK's largest
OL,4,Abeaver enclosure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCustodian of the estate Anselm Guise
OL,7,Fsaid "protecting and restoring nature"
OL,8,Fcould not "sit apart from making the
OL,9,Festate work economically". He said he
OL,10,Fwas "constantly working to find this
OL,11,Fbalance".
